WEBVTT

00:05:28.913 --> 00:05:32.829
And I think, you know, especially
in the wake of this pandemic and

00:05:32.829 --> 00:05:37.829
a global recession where we're facing a
lot of threats to control right now.

00:05:38.246 --> 00:05:42.163
And I wonder if if part of what people
are doing is they're grasping at

00:05:42.163 --> 00:05:43.663
the things they do have control over.

00:05:43.663 --> 00:05:46.246
And one of the things we all have
control over is what we believe.

00:05:46.746 --> 00:05:49.871
And so, you know, holding fast to the
things that I think are true,

00:05:50.329 --> 00:05:54.413
they make that sort of makes the world
feel more predictable, less uncertain.

00:05:54.996 --> 00:05:58.246
It also gives me a sense of belonging
with whoever my tribe is. Right.

00:05:58.246 --> 00:05:59.538
It validates my worldview.